# Deny-by-default. This build never needs source, tests, docs, git
# metadata, build tooling, or anything else in the repository: the
# binary is compiled outside this build and COPY'd in (see the
# Dockerfile's header comment), so the context should carry only the
# handful of files the Dockerfile actually references. Everything is
# excluded unless explicitly allowed back in below, rather than trying
# to enumerate everything that must stay out (certificate and key
# material included) and hoping the list is complete.
*

